# A kick far too weak to bleach anything: the fields obey linear equations with constant coefficients, and light sloshes between the cavities at the coupling rate while it decays.
# Reference: the closed form from the eigenmodes of the coupled cavities, within 0.2%.
title Dark regime: pair alpha0
laser alpha=0
sites 2
link 1 2 kappa=0.1
kick 1 amplitude=0.001
run 45
expect total 0
expect count 1 0
expect count 2 0
expect intensity 1 5 1.71843950e-07 2e-3
expect intensity 2 5 5.12862101e-08 2e-3
expect intensity 2 15 1.10534099e-08 2e-3
expect intensity 1 20 4.29265814e-10 2e-3
expect total 0
